            <div xml:id="d1105">

                <pb facs="1142" n="1132" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1132"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.801/9–749: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Shanghai</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >McConaughy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-09-07T13:00:00+08:00">September 7,
                            1949—1 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 7—3:26 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3683. Mytel 3498, August 27. <hi rendition="#italic">Flying Independent</hi>
                    still scheduled for Shanghai but arrival date Shanghai now about September 14.
                    Pattison Co. state also expect bring in <hi rendition="#italic">Flying
                        Clipper</hi> after call at Taku Bar. <hi rendition="#italic">Clipper</hi>
                    due Taku about September 13 and Shanghai 16. ConGen informed by one of Shanghai
                    pilots Nationalist patrol vessel off mouth Yangtze has moved into territorial
                    waters, being stationed directly in channel. Difficult see how Pattison ships
                    can pass in without interference and Pattison personally offers no reason for
                    believing they can. ConGen has offered Pattison no advice but keeping touch re
                    proposed calls.</p>
                <p>Sent Department; repeated Nanking 1928, OffEmb Canton 1085.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
